{'symbol': 'ESS', 'date': '2021-12-13 16:15:00', 'title': "ESSEX PROPERTY TRUST RECOGNIZED IN NEWSWEEK'S 2022 LIST OF MOST RESPONSIBLE COMPANIES IN AMERICA", 'text': "SAN MATEO, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ESSEX PROPERTY TRUST, INC. (NYSE:ESS) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS BEEN NAMED TO NEWSWEEK'S LIST OF AMERICA'S MOST RESPONSIBLE COMPANIES 2022, IMPROVING 201 SPOTS FROM THE PRIOR YEAR'S LIST. ESSEX RANKED 2ND AMONG MULTIFAMILY REITS, 7TH IN THE REAL ESTATE & HOUSING INDUSTRY AND 105TH OUT OF 500 COMPANIES. THE FULL LIST OF COMPANIES CAN BE FOUND AT HTTPS://WWW.NEWSWEEK.COM/AMERICAS-MOST-RESPONSIBLE-COMPANIES-2022. “AMIDST A CHALLENGING YEAR IN 2021 FROM CON"}